  "summary_en": "Japan's Export Trade Control Order (Cabinet Order No. 378 of 1949, as amended to October 2026) sets licensing and approval requirements for exporting listed goods (including dual-use and military items) to specified destinations, with special sanctions for Russia, Belarus and North Korea. It contains no AI or robotics-specific provisions in the excerpt.",
