   "Catch-all controls for goods possibly used for nuclear, chemical, biological weapons or missiles/UAVs of 300km range",
   "Special approval requirements for exports to Russia, Belarus, North Korea and occupied Ukrainian regions",
   "Permits and approvals valid six months; customs verify permits",
   "Minister may require reports from exporters and producers"
